ax-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed text-white opacity-70 transition-colors duration-300\">Navio integrates seamlessly into your platform, guiding users, automating workflows, and revealing insights that drive adoption.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:gap-0 relative\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"relative p-6 lg:p-8 flex flex-col items-start min-h-[400px] md:min-h-[480px]\"><div class=\"w-full mb-2 -ml-8\"><div class=\"relative w-full h-full flex items-end justify-end\"><div class=\"relative flex flex-col items-end gap-4 w-full max-w-[480px] px-4\"><button data-slot=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive text-primary-foreground px-4 py-2 has-[&gt;svg]:px-3 h-12 w-12 sm:h-14 sm:w-14 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 rounded-full shadow-2xl flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"tabler-icon tabler-icon-player-play h-6 w-6 sm:h-7 sm:w-7 text-white\"><path d=\"M7 4v16l13 -8z\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div><div class=\"text-center mt-auto\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-card-foreground transition-colors duration-300 mb-4\">Custom In-App Widget</h3><p class=\"leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground transition-colors duration-300\">Fully integrated widget that respects your brand&#x27;s design system.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"hidden md:block absolute left-1/2 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-border\"></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"relative p-6 lg:p-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-[400px] md:min-h-[480px]\"><div class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-center mb-18\"><div><div class=\"z-0 h-full max-h-[400px] w-full max-w-[480px] rounded-xl border border-border bg-background p-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-y-2 border-b border-border p-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-x-2\"><div class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-red-500\"></div><div class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-yellow-500\"></div><div class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-green-500\"></div></div></div><div class=\"space-y-3 p-4\"><div class=\"animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-4 w-[150px]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(-5px)\"></div><div class=\"animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-4 w-[200px]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(-5px)\"></div><div class=\"animate-pulse rounded-md bg-muted h-4 w-[180px]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(-5px)\"></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"text-center mt-auto\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-card-foreground transition-colors duration-300 mb-4\">Seamless Integration</h3><p class=\"leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground transition-colors duration-300\">Embed our lightweight agent with a single line of code. No complex SDKs.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-24 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"text-center mb-10\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold mb-4 text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Activate Users. Transform Your Product.</h2><p class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed text-white opacity-70 transition-colors duration-300\">Solve user problems the moment they appear and learn from every interaction to build a better product, faster.</p></d