ext-left text-lg font-light text-white hover:text-white/80\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\">How is Navio different from product tours or support chatbots?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"open\" id=\"radix-_R_1hkpbtb_\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_hkpbtb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-slot=\"accordion-content\" class=\"overflow-hidden text-sm transition-all data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"><div class=\"pb-4 pt-0 text-base text-muted-foreground\">Unlike passive product tours that only point to features, Navio actively guides user step-by-step or automates entire workflows in real time. It&#x27;s not a chatbot; it’s an expert co-pilot that works directly inside your application.</div></div></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-slot=\"accordion-item\" class=\"border-b\"><h3 data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\" class=\"flex\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_1ikpbtb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_ikpbtb_\" data-slot=\"accordion-trigger\" class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between py-4 transition-all hover:underline [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 text-left text-lg font-light text-white hover:text-white/80\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\">What can Navio do inside our application?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_1ikpbtb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_ikpbtb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-slot=\"accordion-content\" class=\"overflow-hidden text-sm transition-all data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-slot=\"accordion-item\" class=\"border-b\"><h3 data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\" class=\"flex\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_1jkpbtb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_jkpbtb_\" data-slot=\"accordion-trigger\" class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between py-4 transition-all hover:underline [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 text-left text-lg font-light text-white hover:text-white/80\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\">How does Navio integrate with our product?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_1jkpbtb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_jkpbtb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" dat